{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：08:57 2026-10-21 HKT<br/>發佈時間：08:57 2026-10-21 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：08:57 2026-10-21 HKT</p><img alt=\"啟德簡約公屋2歲女嬰暈倒送院。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/bd63d0561e061262561d399424f68381/2026-10/page_154.jpg\"/><p>今日（21日）早上7時35分，啟德世運道20號簡約公屋一名2歲女嬰暈倒，其母親發現大驚，報警求助。救護員到場，將女嬰送往伊利沙伯醫院，幸女嬰經治理後轉醒。據了解，女嬰身患疾病，警方列作病人案件調查。</p><img alt=\"現場是啟德世運道20號。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0ae99befcac2f7364a7fb9594ef27189/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-21_at_08_45_35_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"啟德簡約公屋一名2歲女嬰暈倒送院。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/70e6ae4b39b5ebd7a15e486f7df05ecb/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-21_at_08_45_34_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8e81e0bc54672c9a5a0db7faacac1fbd/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-21_at_08_45_34_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1e5d3eed59aaeab76f7bb447e32d6389/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-21_at_08_45_34.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/07765b271ae98b5f344827b21d2c4f48/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-21_at_08_45_33_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e68e51566245327784bcfc635d34ea2b/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-21_at_08_45_33_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6d70ec4fa1ce25fec331957fc985cc25/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-21_at_08_45_33.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8b969bbd09dac3be42e597b4f26e5c6b/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-21_at_08_45_35.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T01:20:35.619858+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":182,"images":9,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T00:57:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T04:18:05.737104+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T01:18:09.871341+00:00","content_hash":"53632040d0955e204d7c910e5c4d5ca2cbba990a